    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several people dream one dream, where they can get together in strange locations and look for a way out... You can change the character by running up to him... By touching his hand with your hand... Somewhere you will have to play for one character without choosing others... Some characters can shoot energy bolts. Some jump differently than others... The goal is to find a way out. Somewhere there are guns that shoot energy balls that you need to avoid...\u00a0Somewhere you can get into a car.</p>",
